'' Under -mt -exx, a procedure's entry (fb_ErrorSetFuncName -> fb_TlsGetCtx -> TlsGetValue)
'' cleared the Win32 last error before the procedure could read it (lib/rt/src/thread/ctx.tiko;
'' ApexWealth-2026 AW-006: std/net failed every request). Links the PACKAGED runtime, so it
'' fails until the toolchain is repackaged with that fix.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -mt -exx tests/codegen/src/mt-exx-lasterror.tiko -o tests/codegen/mtexxlasterror.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/mtexxlasterror.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/mtexxlasterror.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 10035
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 10061
